a)	Create a Simple Spring REST Controller.
Aim: To create and run a simple REST controller with CRUD operations in a Spring Boot application. 

Procedure
1.	Go to https://start.spring.io/. 
2.	Select the following options: 
o	Project: Maven Project 
o	Language: Java 
o	Spring Boot: Latest Stable Version 
3.	Add the following dependency: 
o	Spring Web
4.	Click Generate to download the project zip file. 
5.	Extract the file and open the project directory in an IDE (VS Code or IntelliJ IDEA). 
6.	Create the required resource model and REST controller classes inside the package structure. 
7.	Run the main application class to boot up the embedded Tomcat server. 

